{"2:120":[{"type":"text","text":"Never will the Jews nor the Christians be pleased with you "},{"type":"annotation","text":"(O Muhammad صلى الله عليه وسلم)"},{"type":"text","text":" till you follow their religion. Say: \"Verily, the Guidance of Allâh "},{"type":"annotation","text":"(i.e. Islâmic Monotheism)"},{"type":"text","text":" that is the "},{"type":"annotation","text":"(only)"},{"type":"text","text":" Guidance. And if you "},{"type":"annotation","text":"(O Muhammad صلى الله عليه وسلم)"},{"type":"text","text":" were to follow their "},{"type":"annotation","text":"(Jews and Christians)"},{"type":"text","text":" desires after what you have received of Knowledge "},{"type":"annotation","text":"(i.e. the Qur’ân)"},{"type":"text","text":", then you would have against Allâh neither any Walî "},{"type":"annotation","text":"(protector or guardian)"},{"type":"text","text":" nor any helper."}],"2:121":[{"type":"text","text":"Those "},{"type":"annotation","text":"(who embraced Islâm from Banî Israel)"},{"type":"text","text":" to whom We gave the Book "},{"type":"annotation","text":"[the Taurât (Torah)]"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"annotation","text":"[or those (Muhammad’s صلى الله عليه وسلم companions) to whom We have given the Book (the Qur’ân)]"},{"type":"text","text":" recite it "},{"type":"annotation","text":"(i.e. obey its orders and follow its teachings)"},{"type":"text","text":" as it should be recited "},{"type":"annotation","text":"(i.e. followed)"},{"type":"text","text":", they are the ones who believe therein. And whoso disbelieve in it "},{"type":"annotation","text":"(the Qur’ân)"},{"type":"text","text":", those are they who are the losers. "},{"type":"annotation","text":"(Tafsir Al-Qurtubî)"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"2:122":[{"type":"text","text":"O Children of Israel! Remember My Favour which I bestowed upon you and that I preferred you to the ‘Âlamîn "},{"type":"annotation","text":"[mankind and jinn (of your time-period, in the past)]"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"2:123":[{"type":"text","text":"And fear the Day "},{"type":"annotation","text":"(of Judgement)"},{"type":"text","text":" when no person shall avail another, nor shall compensation be accepted from him, nor shall intercession be of use to him, nor shall they be helped."}],"2:124":[{"type":"text","text":"And "},{"type":"annotation","text":"(remember)"},{"type":"text","text":" when the Lord of Ibrâhîm "},{"type":"annotation","text":"(Abraham)"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"annotation","text":"[i.e., Allâh]"},{"type":"text","text":" tried him with "},{"type":"annotation","text":"(certain)"},{"type":"text","text":" Commands,"},{"type":"footnote","id":"154349","label":"1"},{"type":"text","text":" which he fulfilled. He "},{"type":"annotation","text":"(Allâh)"},{"type":"text","text":" said "},{"type":"annotation","text":"(to him)"},{"type":"text","text":", \"Verily, I am going to make you an Imâm "},{"type":"annotation","text":"(a leader)"},{"type":"text","text":" for mankind "},{"type":"annotation","text":"(to follow you)"},{"type":"text","text":".\" "},{"type":"annotation","text":"[Ibrâhîm (Abraham)]"},{"type":"text","text":" said, \"And of my offspring "},{"type":"annotation","text":"(to make leaders)"},{"type":"text","text":".\" "},{"type":"annotation","text":"(Allâh)"},{"type":"text","text":" said, \"My Covenant "},{"type":"annotation","text":"(Prophethood)"},{"type":"text","text":" includes not Zâlimûn "},{"type":"annotation","text":"(polytheists and wrong-doers)"},{"type":"text","text":".\""}],"2:125":[{"type":"text","text":"And "},{"type":"annotation","text":"(remember)"},{"type":"text","text":" when We made the House "},{"type":"annotation","text":"(the Ka‘bah at Makkah)"},{"type":"text","text":" a place of resort for mankind and a place of safety. And take you "},{"type":"annotation","text":"(people)"},{"type":"text","text":" the Maqâm "},{"type":"annotation","text":"(place)"},{"type":"text","text":" of Ibrâhîm "},{"type":"annotation","text":"(Abraham)"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"annotation","text":"[or the stone on which Ibrâhîm (Abraham) عليه السلام stood while he was building the Ka‘bah]"},{"type":"text","text":" as a place of prayer "},{"type":"annotation","text":"(for some of your prayers, e.g. two Rak‘at after the Tawâf of the Ka‘bahat Makkah)"},{"type":"text","text":", and We commanded Ibrâhîm "},{"type":"annotation","text":"(Abraham)"},{"type":"text","text":" and Ismâ‘îl "},{"type":"annotation","text":"(Ishmael)"},{"type":"text","text":" that they should purify My House "},{"type":"annotation","text":"(the Ka‘bah at Makkah)"},{"type":"text","text":" for those who are circumambulating it, or staying "},{"type":"annotation","text":"(I‘tikâf)"},{"type":"text","text":", or bowing or prostrating themselves "},{"type":"annotation","text":"(there, in prayer)"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"2:126":[{"type":"text","text":"And "},{"type":"annotation","text":"(remember)"},{"type":"text","text":" when Ibrâhîm "},{"type":"annotation","text":"(Abraham)"},{"type":"text","text":" said, \"My Lord, make this city "},{"type":"annotation","text":"(Makkah)"},{"type":"text","text":" a place of security and provide its people with fruits, such of them as believe in Allâh and the Last Day.\" He "},{"type":"annotation","text":"(Allâh)"},{"type":"text","text":" answered: \"As for him who disbelieves, I shall leave him in contentment for a while, then I shall compel him to the torment of the Fire, and worst indeed is that destination!\""}]}